      "text": "Surinder Kaur vs State Of Punjab And Another on 12 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/73390127/\n1 3. Counsel for the respondent submits charges against the pe\"\"oner have already been framed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
