      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "4. A perusal of the pe\"\"on reveals that only FIR has been challenged and once a judicial order has been passed framing the charges, that judicial order must be explicitly challenged which has not been done in the present case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1181,
      "end": 1408,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "5. Given above, the present pe\"\"on is dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
